  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORTH-EASTERN DISTRICTS INTEGRATED RURAL DEV PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE MAIN AIM OF THIS PROJECT IS TO IMPROVE SOCIO_ECONOMIC CONDITIONS OF THE RURAL PEOPLE. IT WILL FOCUS ON A) NEW IDEAS ON FARMING AND OFF_FARM ACTIVITIES B) TRAINING AND PROFESSIONAL EXCHANGES WITH OTHER EUROPEAN MOUNTANIOUS REGNS C) INJECTING COST INCOME THROUGH A VARIETY OF RURAL WORKS PROGRAM  SMALL SCALE CREDIT. THIS WILL INCLUDE A RECONST. RUCTION AND DEV. OF 270 MICRO PROJECTS.</narrative>
  </description>
